{"seq":2,"slug":"radar-methodology","title":"雷达方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/radar-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"radar-quadrants-rings","title":"象限与环的设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/radar-methodology/radar-quadrants-rings","wordCount":1913,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"assessment-scoring-process","title":"评估与打分流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/radar-methodology/assessment-scoring-process","wordCount":1923,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"radar-governance-cadence","title":"雷达治理与节奏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/radar-methodology/radar-governance-cadence","wordCount":1891,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 雷达方法论\n\n技术雷达并非 ThoughtWorks 的专利——它是一种可复制的组织级技术评估方法论。本章解构雷达的设计原理：象限如何分类技术关注点、环级如何编码采纳建议、评估流程如何保证信号质量、治理节奏如何让雷达成为持续运转的决策引擎而非一次性的技术盘点。\n\n从基础章节的决策框架到本章的雷达方法论，你将看到战略思维如何被编码为可操作的组织流程。后续的创新章节则展示雷达信号如何驱动具体的技术探索行动。\n"}